# Loupe's own data: the live database file (SQLite is writing it), the caches and the keeper's working context never go in. The whole record (settings, API keys,
# passphrase hash, sessions, history, captures, keeper readings) goes in only as data/backup/, written by `python loupe.py backup export` (the admin, 2026-11-16).
# What travels with the repo so a clone opens with the sample library: the sample images, the admin's uploads, the flag evidence and the seed
# (data/seed/loupe-seed.db, written by `python loupe.py seed export`: misses, moments and flags with every secret stripped).
data/*
!data/samples/
!data/uploads/
!data/flags/
!data/seed/
!data/backup/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.env
*.bak
*.bak-*
data/seed/*-wal
data/seed/*-shm
data/seed/*.tmp
